NoFace: {
	DisplayName: The Faceless Woman
	Origin: On a rain-soaked bridge, she borrowed your face
	Power: 「Borrowed Face」Steals a target's visage and briefly copies their abilities
	DeathReason: "{0}触犯了不可触犯之物"
}

LanternBoy: {
	DisplayName: The Lantern Boy
	Origin: A lamp at the end of the mountain road, no one beneath it; look again, and you are the one inside the lamp
	Power: 「Guiding Light」Shadows cast by the lantern mirror the bearer's actions, wielding six-tenths of their strength
	DeathReason: "{0}触犯了不可触犯之物"
}

CrimsonBride: {
	DisplayName: The Crimson Bride
	Origin: The bridal palanquin waited at the gate for seven nights
	Power: 「The Procession」The final piece of the set; allows Ghost Lanterns to be stacked upon yourself
	DeathReason: "{0}触犯了不可触犯之物"
}

StandIn: {
	DisplayName: The Stand-In Ledger
	Origin: Inside the yellowed hardback ledger, one page clings fast to your date of birth
	Power: 「Stand-In」The instant a lethal strike or curse falls, the damage is forcibly transferred away
	DeathReason: "{0}触犯了不可触犯之物"
}

HeadlessShade: {
	DisplayName: The Headless Figure
	Origin: The shadow at your feet twitches; on nights when the lamplight sways, there is nothing above its shoulders
	Power: 「Limb-Splice」Dismantles a target's limbs, or grafts its own severed body back together to recover
	DeathReason: "{0}触犯了不可触犯之物"
}

GhostHand: {
	DisplayName: The Charred Hand
	Origin: A length of charred, withered, horrifying arm
	Power: 「Grip」A target caught in its clutch is suppressed and restrained
	DeathReason: "{0}触犯了不可触犯之物"
}

WellThing: {
	DisplayName: The Ringing in the Well
	Origin: ———
	Power: ———
	DeathReason: "{0}触犯了不可触犯之物"
}

DebugWraith: {
	DisplayName: Debug Wraith
	Origin: A colorless specimen. It exists only to prove the machinery of haunting still turns
	Power: 「Placeholder」— it drifts, it stares back, and it scatters at a touch
	DeathReason: "{0}触犯了不可触犯之物"
}

